; Journal.add_xact, called from Python after parsing has finished, applies
; the journal's automated transactions and account check directives just
; as parsing applies them to a transaction read from the file.

account Expenses:Food
    check amount < $5

= /^Expenses:Food/
    (Budget:Food)    -1

2026/01/01 Opening
    Assets:Cash        $100.00
    Equity:Opening

test python test/regress/py-add-xact-automated.py
added: True
Expenses:Food $10.00
Assets:Cash $-10.00
Budget:Food $-10.00
__ERROR__
Warning: Transaction check failed: (amount < {$5.00})
  (check expression at "$FILE", line 5)
end test
